<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<rdf:RDF
   xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
   xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
   xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#containsFood">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">포함 식품 항목</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Contains Food Item</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">식단 기록에 포함된 개별 섭취 식품 항목을 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a meal log entry to the individual food items consumed within it.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietaryMealLog"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#FoodItem"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#followsDietPlan">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">적용 식이 플랜</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Follows Diet Plan</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">프로필이 현재 채택하여 실천 중인 식이 처방 플랜을 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a profile to the active nutritional and dietary prescription regimen.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#WeightLossProfile"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietaryPlan"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#targetProfile">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">개입 대상 프로필</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Target Profile</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">코칭 개입의 혜택을 받는 대상 관리 프로필을 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Identifies the target weight management profile recipient of the coaching action.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#CoachingInterventionTask"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#WeightLossProfile"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#recordedAt">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">계측 측정 시각</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Measurement Timestamp</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">체성분이 정밀 측정되어 전산에 등록된 일시.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">ISO 8601 standardized timestamp when the biometric body composition assessment occurred.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#BodyCompositionRecord"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#NutritionistAgent">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietCoachingAgent"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">임상 영양 분석 에이전트</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Nutritionist Specialist Agent</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">영양소 균형, 혈당 스파이크 방지, 단백질 최적 섭취량을 정밀 설계하는 영양 전문 에이전트.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Specialized algorithmic agent optimizing macronutrient ratios, satiety indices, and nutritional density.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#WeightLossProfile">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">체중감량 관리 프로필</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Weight Loss Profile</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">체중 감량과 건강 증진을 목표로 식이와 운동을 추적하는 개인화된 대사 관리 프로필.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Personalized metabolic wellness profile tracking nutritional intake and exercise for weight management.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#MetabolicDailySummary">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">일일 대사 수지 요약</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Metabolic Daily Summary</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">총 섭취 칼로리와 총 소비 칼로리를 비교하여 산출한 일일 순 칼로리 결손량 및 대사 균형 요약.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Comprehensive daily energy balance ledger calculating net caloric deficit and metabolic trajectory.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#fatGrams">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">지방 함량</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Fat In Grams</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">식사에 포함된 지질 영양소 총량 (단위: g).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Total dietary lipid fat mass ingested during the meal expressed in grams.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietaryMealLog"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#interventionAction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">코칭 중재 지침</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Intervention Action Text</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사용자의 대사 상태에 대응하여 AI 코치가 지시한 구체적 실행 지침.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Actionable prescription narrative generated by the AI coach to overcome plateaus or improve compliance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#CoachingInterventionTask"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#triggeredByAlert">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">유발 원인 경보</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Triggered By Alert</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">코칭 개입 작업이 시작되도록 유발한 정체기 경보를 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links an intervention task to the triggering metabolic or plateau alert.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#CoachingInterventionTask"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#PlateauAlert"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#mealType">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">식사 구분</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Meal Category Type</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">섭취된 식사의 종류로 BREAKFAST, LUNCH, DINNER, SNACK 중 하나의 값을 취한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Discrete categorical classification of the feeding event such as BREAKFAST, LUNCH, DINNER, or SNACK.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietaryMealLog"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#weightKg">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">계측 체중</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Measured Weight In Kg</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">측정 시점에 기록된 실제 신체 몸무게 (단위: kg).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Actual measured gross body mass recorded during the assessment session in kilograms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#BodyCompositionRecord"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#executedByCoach">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/core#runAgent"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">개입 실행 코치 에이전트</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Executed By Coach</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">해당 코칭 중재 작업을 생성하고 전달한 AI 에이전트를 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Designates the AI coaching agent responsible for dispatching the intervention.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#CoachingInterventionTask"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietCoachingAgent"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#profileName">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">사용자 성명</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Profile User Name</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">감량 관리 프로필의 사용자 표시 이름.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Human-readable display name or pseudonym identifying the profile subject.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#WeightLossProfile"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#targetDailyCalorieDeficit">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">일일 목표 칼로리 결손량</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Target Daily Calorie Deficit</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">안전한 체지방 감량을 위해 하루 동안 유지해야 하는 칼로리 결손 권장치 (단위: kcal).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Recommended daily negative energy balance target in kilocalories for gradual adipose reduction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#TargetGoal"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#BodyCompositionRecord">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">체성분 계측 기록</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Body Composition Record</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">특정 시점에 측정된 체중, 골격근량, 체지방량, 체질량지수(BMI), 기초대사량(BMR) 데이터.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Biometric measurement record capturing weight, skeletal muscle mass, body fat, BMI, and basal metabolic rate.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#logsMeal">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">식단 기록 연결</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Logs Meal</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">프로필에 등록된 식단 및 음식물 섭취 기록을 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Associates a user profile with chronological dietary meal log entries.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#WeightLossProfile"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietaryMealLog"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#FitnessTrainerAgent">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietCoachingAgent"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">운동 처방 트레이너 에이전트</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Fitness Trainer Specialist Agent</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">개인의 근력 수준과 회복 상태에 맞추어 유산소 및 저항성 운동 프로그램을 설계하는 에이전트.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Specialized athletic agent prescribing progressive resistance training and cardiovascular expenditure protocols.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#PlateauAlert">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">체중 정체기 감지 경보</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Weight Loss Plateau Alert</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">지속적인 칼로리 결손에도 불구하고 일정 기간 체중 변화가 정체될 때 발행되는 분석 경보.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automated analytic notification triggered when weight loss stalls despite sustained caloric deficit.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#hasDailySummary">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">일일 대사 요약 연결</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Has Daily Summary</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">프로필의 일자별 종합 에너지 및 대사 수지 요약을 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Connects a profile to its aggregated daily metabolic balance summary.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#WeightLossProfile"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#MetabolicDailySummary"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#detectedOnProfile">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">정체 감지 프로필</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Detected On Profile</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">정체기 현상이 감지된 대상 관리 프로필을 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Associates a plateau alert with the specific profile demonstrating stagnant weight loss.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#PlateauAlert"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#WeightLossProfile"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#bmi">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">체질량지수 BMI</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Body Mass Index</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">체중(kg)을 신장의 제곱(m²)으로 나눈 비만 판정 표준 지수.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Standard epidemiological anthropometric metric dividing weight by squared height.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#BodyCompositionRecord"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#FoodItem">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">섭취 식품 항목</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Food Item</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">식단에 포함된 개별 음식 원재료 또는 완제품 식품 단위.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Discrete food product or dietary component consumed within a recorded meal session.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#bodyFatMassKg">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">체지방량</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Body Fat Mass In Kg</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">생체 임피던스 또는 DEXA로 측정된 순수 체지방 질량 (단위: kg).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Absolute mass of adipose tissue measured via bioelectrical impedance or densitometry in kilograms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#BodyCompositionRecord"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#carbohydrateGrams">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">탄수화물 함량</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Carbohydrate In Grams</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">식사에 포함된 탄수화물 영양소 총량 (단위: g).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Total carbohydrate nutrient mass ingested during the meal expressed in grams.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietaryMealLog"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#exerciseType">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">운동 유형</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Exercise Modality Type</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">수행한 운동의 분류로 AEROBIC, RESISTANCE, HIIT, WALKING 값을 가진다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Specific training modality undertaken such as AEROBIC, RESISTANCE, HIIT, or WALKING.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#ExerciseSession"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#heightCm">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">신장 신체 키</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Height In Centimeters</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">신체 질량 지수(BMI) 계산에 사용되는 사용자의 키 (단위: cm).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Body stature height measured in centimeters used for anthropometric indexing.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#WeightLossProfile"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietCoachingAgent">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/core#Agent"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">체중감량 AI 코칭 에이전트</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Weight Loss AI Coaching Agent</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사용자의 라이프로그를 실시간 분석하여 최적의 감량 솔루션을 제공하는 인공지능 웰니스 코치.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Autonomous artificial intelligence wellness agent synthesizing biometric streams into adaptive weight guidance.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#bmrKcal">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">기초대사량 BMR</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Basal Metabolic Rate</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">생명 유지를 위해 신체가 완전 휴식 상태에서 소모하는 최소 열량 (단위: kcal).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Minimum daily energy expenditure required to sustain biological homeostasis at rest in kilocalories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#BodyCompositionRecord"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#burnedCaloriesKcal">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">운동 소비 열량</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Burned Calories In Kcal</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">운동 세션을 통해 소모된 추정 활동 대사 열량 (단위: kcal).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Estimated energy expenditure expended during the workout session in kilocalories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#ExerciseSession"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#hasTargetGoal">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">목표 설정 연결</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Has Target Goal</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">프로필에 설정된 체중 감량 목표 정보를 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Associates a weight loss profile with its active quantitative targets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#WeightLossProfile"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#TargetGoal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#ExerciseSession">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">신체 운동 활동 기록</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Exercise Session</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">유산소, 근력, 인터벌 등 칼로리를 소모하고 근육량을 보존하기 위해 수행한 운동 세션.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Physical activity session executed to expend energy, preserve lean mass, and stimulate metabolic rate.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#proteinGrams">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">단백질 함량</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Protein In Grams</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">식사에 포함된 단백질 영양소 총량 (단위: g).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Total protein nutrient mass ingested during the meal expressed in grams.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietaryMealLog"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietaryMealLog">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">식단 섭취 기록</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dietary Meal Log</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">아침, 점심, 저녁, 간식 등 특정 식사 시점에 섭취한 칼로리 및 3대 영양소 함량 기록.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Nutritional consumption log capturing calories and macronutrient breakdown across scheduled meals.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#targetBodyFatPercent">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">목표 체지방률</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Target Body Fat Percentage</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">최종 달성하고자 하는 목표 체지방률 백분율 (단위: %).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Optimal targeted body fat ratio expressed as a percentage of total body mass.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#TargetGoal"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#taskStatus">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/core#taskStatus"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">작업 진행 상태</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Task Lifecycle Status</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">코칭 개입 작업의 전달 및 수행 완료 상태 (PENDING, ACTIVE, COMPLETED, DISMISSED).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Operational lifecycle status of the coaching action taking values PENDING, ACTIVE, COMPLETED, or DISMISSED.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#CoachingInterventionTask"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#logsExercise">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">운동 활동 연결</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Logs Exercise</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">프로필에 기록된 신체 운동 및 활동 세션을 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Associates a weight loss profile with executed physical workout sessions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#WeightLossProfile"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#ExerciseSession"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">체중감량 및 식이·운동 대사 헬스케어 AI 에이전트 온톨로지</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Weight Loss and Metabolic Healthcare AI Agent Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">체중 감량 목표, 체성분 계측, 식단 영양소 섭취, 신체 운동 활동, 일일 대사 수지 및 AI 코칭 에이전트 상호작용 체계를 정의한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Defines weight loss goals, body composition metrics, dietary nutrition intake, physical exercise, metabolic balance, and AI coaching agents.</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:imports rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/core"/>
    <owl:imports rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov-o#"/>
    <owl:versionInfo>1.0.0</owl:versionInfo>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#durationMinutes">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">운동 수행 시간</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Exercise Duration Minutes</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">운동 세션을 지속한 순수 활동 시간 (단위: 분).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Total net duration of physical exercise completed during the session in minutes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#ExerciseSession"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#MetabolicMonitorAgent">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietCoachingAgent"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">대사 항상성 모니터링 에이전트</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Metabolic Monitor Specialist Agent</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">기초대사량 저하, 적응성 열발생, 정체기 징후를 조기에 감지하여 전략을 전환하는 전문 에이전트.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Specialized physiological agent monitoring adaptive thermogenesis, starvation responses, and weight loss plateaus.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#netCalorieDeficitKcal">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">일일 순 칼로리 결손량</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Net Daily Calorie Deficit</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">일일 총 에너지 소모량에서 총 섭취 열량을 감산한 순수 결손 칼로리 (단위: kcal).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Net difference between total daily energy expenditure and total caloric intake in kilocalories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#MetabolicDailySummary"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#assignedAgent">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">전담 코칭 에이전트</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Assigned Coaching Agent</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사용자의 감량 과정을 밀착 지도하는 주 담당 AI 코칭 에이전트를 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Assigns a primary autonomous coaching agent to guide the individual weight management process.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#WeightLossProfile"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietCoachingAgent"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#TargetGoal">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">체중감량 목표 설정</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Weight Loss Target Goal</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">목표 체중, 목표 체지방률, 목표 기한 및 일일 목표 칼로리 결손량 설정 정보.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Quantitative target milestones including target weight, body fat percentage, and daily caloric deficit.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#mealCaloriesKcal">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">식사 총 섭취 열량</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Meal Caloric Content</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">해당 식사에서 섭취한 음식의 총 에너지 열량 (단위: kcal).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Total caloric energy consumed during the specific meal session in kilocalories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietaryMealLog"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#skeletalMuscleMassKg">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">골격근량</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Skeletal Muscle Mass In Kg</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">대사 활성 조직인 신체 골격근의 총 중량 (단위: kg).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Total mass of metabolically active skeletal muscle tissue in kilograms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#BodyCompositionRecord"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#targetWeightKg">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">목표 체중</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Target Weight In Kg</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">감량 목표로 설정된 최종 희망 체중 (단위: kg).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Target body weight intended to be attained at the end of the program in kilograms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#TargetGoal"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#hasBodyComposition">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">체성분 계측치 연결</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Has Body Composition</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">프로필에 시계열로 축적된 체성분 측정 기록을 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Associates a profile with historical or recent body composition measurement entries.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#WeightLossProfile"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/diet#BodyCompositionRecord"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#DietaryPlan">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">식이 처방 플랜</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dietary Plan</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">저탄고지, 고단백, 간헐적 단식, 지중해식 등 체중 감량을 위해 설계된 식이요법 가이드라인.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Structured nutritional guideline and macronutrient regimen designed for sustainable weight reduction.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/diet#CoachingInterventionTask">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/core#TaskRun"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">코칭 개입 작업 실행</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Coaching Intervention Task</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">AI 코칭 에이전트가 식단 조정, 운동 강도 변경, 휴식 권고 등 사용자의 행동 변화를 유도한 실행 기록.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Actionable behavioral intervention dispatched by an AI coach to adjust nutrition or training volume.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
</rdf:RDF>
